7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4g6K7TANKN4Q7kNvwH7yRoz&_nc_oc=AdpW_gn6Q7_qpQH3rQ8oL-WbN4-hwCYD9wZ1TLSQ-rNtw4Ymt5YvrLe1QSRnz8gBANk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSM1FNCa87reSsTqTh1OQXKQ0H1PKBDZtkKI-ljDV7prg&oe=6B08419A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "4596146003944923", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036697_4596146007278256_3277507150616169599_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-EmChVgrYcIQ7kNvwGMhXoP&_nc_oc=AdqkiPjhWhkrmHnlfCowKG1_Ri6woPBoVEv3IW2wLqWQYeVzb00RQqHxiODfLvDfnh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHA5OgXTFsNDhqBWAv_N-3pWwx0A3ffIJePvFYezA0HQ&oe=6B085C74"}, "display_name": "Mountain Bike Downhill", "keywords": ["bike", "motorbike", "race", "offroad", "bicycle"], "long_description": "Dive into an exhilarating adventure through the world of off-road mountain bike racing and speed with \"Mountain Bike Downhill\". Explore breathtaking natural landscapes, thrilling races, and endless exploration opportunities.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6Career Mode:\nTake on a series of exhilarating challenges.\nUnlock new levels and bikes as you progress.\nMaster each stunt for the ultimate gaming glory.\n\n\ud83d\udeb4Stunt Mode:\nPerform jaw-dropping stunts \nConquer challenges with stunt bikes\n\n\ud83d\udd52Time Trials:\nCarry objects against the clock in a thrilling Time Trial.\nTest your speed and precision in solo gameplay.\nCompete for the best times and unlock new levels\n\n\ud83d\udeb2Bikes:\nUnlock and choose from a fleet of high-speed, \nEach bike has unique attributes for varied gameplay experiences.\nUpgrade your favorite vehicle for enhanced performance.\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Navigate diverse environments for a dynamic experience.", "short_description": "\"Mountain Bike Downhill \" is all about off-roading, speed, and challenges in VR."}]}, "developer_name": "None Play Games", "develop